<p>The Dragon Age Toolset Wiki supports two of the standard MediaWiki skins: the more traditional MonoBook skin and the newer Vector skin. Some of the new MediaWiki features, such as simple search will only be available if you are using the Vector skin.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Step-by-step">Step-by-step</span></h2>
<p>To start using the Vector skin use the following steps:
</p>
<ol><li> Click on 'my preferences' in the user menu</li>
<li> Click on the 'Appearance' tab</li>
<li> Select the 'Vector' option in the 'Skin' group</li>
<li> Click the 'Save' button at the bottom of the 'my preference' page</li></ol>
<p>If successful, the new skin will be applied and you will be returned to the 'User Profile' tab and you will see a green confirmation message.  If unsuccessful the old skin will remain and you will see a red error message.
</p>
